(C) World A, the history-aware learner (l = 6 > human's 4): its gain - length stays bounded;
    its regret against the human grows like (cells/2) log(n/cells), so the human wins at fixed lambda.
  n=   100: gain(learner) =    -7.71  (regret = 7.7; 40*log2(n/80) = 13)
